{"name": "bj_continents", "dur": 78.933, "video": "540,960", "lang": "en", "segs": [{"s": 0.05, "e": 1.53, "t": "How many continents are there?", "w": [["How", 0.05, 0.51], ["many", 0.51, 0.69], ["continents", 0.69, 1.11], ["are", 1.11, 1.31], ["there?", 1.31, 1.53]]}, {"s": 1.87, "e": 2.93, "t": "Depends who you ask.", "w": [["Depends", 1.87, 2.37], ["who", 2.37, 2.49], ["you", 2.49, 2.61], ["ask.", 2.61, 2.93]]}, {"s": 3.53, "e": 5.43, "t": "In the US, I learned seven.", "w": [["In", 3.53, 3.75], ["the", 3.75, 3.85], ["US,", 3.85, 4.15], ["I", 4.37, 4.65], ["learned", 4.65, 4.97], ["seven.", 4.97, 5.43]]}, {"s": 5.89, "e": 8.21, "t": "North America and South America, two continents.", "w": [["North", 5.89, 6.23], ["America", 6.23, 6.61], ["and", 6.61, 6.79], ["South", 6.79, 6.97], ["America,", 6.97, 7.43], ["two", 7.63, 7.83], ["continents.", 7.83, 8.21]]}, {"s": 8.81, "e": 11.25, "t": "Same in the UK, China, and India.", "w": [["Same", 8.81, 9.29], ["in", 9.29, 9.45], ["the", 9.45, 9.55], ["UK,", 9.55, 9.85], ["China,", 10.23, 10.59], ["and", 10.73, 10.95], ["India.", 10.95, 11.25]]}, {"s": 11.95, "e": 13.51, "t": "Then I went to Latin America.", "w": [["Then", 11.95, 12.27], ["I", 12.27, 12.57], ["went", 12.57, 12.73], ["to", 12.73, 12.87], ["Latin", 12.87, 13.07], ["America.", 13.07, 13.51]]}, {"s": 14.15, "e": 17.39, "t": "There, America is one continent, so six.", "w": [["There,", 14.15, 14.51], ["America", 14.69, 15.09], ["is", 15.09, 15.51], ["one", 15.51, 15.81], ["continent,", 15.81, 16.29], ["so", 16.67, 17.05], ["six.", 17.05, 17.39]]}, {"s": 17.91, "e": 20.07, "t": "Same in Spain, Portugal, and Greece.", "w": [["Same", 17.91, 18.51], ["in", 18.51, 18.67], ["Spain,", 18.67, 18.97], ["Portugal,", 19.21, 19.59], ["and", 19.65, 19.83], ["Greece.", 19.83, 20.07]]}, {"s": 20.45, "e": 24.29, "t": "That's why the Olympic flag has five rings, the five inhabited continents.", "w": [["That's", 20.45, 20.95], ["why", 20.95, 21.05], ["the", 21.05, 21.19], ["Olympic", 21.19, 21.43], ["flag", 21.43, 21.77], ["has", 21.77, 22.11], ["five", 22.11, 22.39], ["rings,", 22.39, 22.79], ["the", 23.01, 23.13], ["five", 23.13, 23.41], ["inhabited", 23.41, 23.85], ["continents.", 23.85, 24.29]]}, {"s": 24.79, "e": 28.05, "t": "In Russia, Europe and Asia are one continent, Eurasia.", "w": [["In", 24.79, 25.23], ["Russia,", 25.23, 25.51], ["Europe", 25.91, 26.21], ["and", 26.21, 26.37], ["Asia", 26.37, 26.63], ["are", 26.63, 26.81], ["one", 26.81, 27.03], ["continent,", 27.03, 27.45], ["Eurasia.", 27.57, 28.05]]}, {"s": 28.05, "e": 29.85, "t": "Merge both, and you get five.", "w": [["Merge", 28.05, 28.81], ["both,", 28.81, 29.05], ["and", 29.17, 29.35], ["you", 29.35, 29.43], ["get", 29.43, 29.55], ["five.", 29.55, 29.85]]}, {"s": 30.39, "e": 32.71, "t": "Africa touches Asia, too, right next to Israel.", "w": [["Africa", 30.39, 30.91], ["touches", 30.91, 31.15], ["Asia,", 31.15, 31.47], ["too,", 31.59, 31.71], ["right", 31.95, 32.13], ["next", 32.13, 32.29], ["to", 32.29, 32.41], ["Israel.", 32.41, 32.71]]}, {"s": 33.23, "e": 34.75, "t": "Merge that, and you're down to four.", "w": [["Merge", 33.23, 33.55], ["that,", 33.55, 33.77], ["and", 33.89, 34.05], ["you're", 34.05, 34.15], ["down", 34.15, 34.27], ["to", 34.27, 34.41], ["four.", 34.41, 34.75]]}, {"s": 35.13, "e": 35.47, "t": "Four.", "w": [["Four.", 35.13, 35.47]]}, {"s": 36.03, "e": 36.97, "t": "So what is a continent?", "w": [["So", 36.03, 36.43], ["what", 36.43, 36.53], ["is", 36.53, 36.59], ["a", 36.59, 36.71], ["continent?", 36.71, 36.97]]}, {"s": 37.33, "e": 37.95, "t": "Plot twist.", "w": [["Plot", 37.33, 37.71], ["twist.", 37.71, 37.95]]}, {"s": 38.17, "e": 39.59, "t": "There's no single scientific definition.", "w": [["There's", 38.17, 38.41], ["no", 38.41, 38.51], ["single", 38.51, 38.81], ["scientific", 38.81, 39.17], ["definition.", 39.17, 39.59]]}, {"s": 39.93, "e": 42.51, "t": "It's convention, land, culture, and history.", "w": [["It's", 39.93, 40.21], ["convention,", 4